# No Caps key any more: a double-tap of shift toggles CapsLock, locking
# shift on. A lone shift release opens a 400 ms window; a second shift
# press inside it fires CapsLock and is swallowed (never reaches the
# app); its release then unlatches nothing. Any other key closes the window.
